<!-- wp:group {"tagName":"section","align":"full","style":{"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"var:preset|spacing|80","bottom":"var:preset|spacing|80"}}},"layout":{"type":"constrained","contentSize":"820px"}} -->
<section class="wp-block-group alignfull" style="padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--80);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--80)"><!-- wp:heading {"textAlign":"center","fontSize":"x-large","style":{"spacing":{"margin":{"bottom":"var:preset|spacing|50"}}}} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-x-large-font-size" style="margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)">Practical Questions</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:group {"style":{"spacing":{"blockGap":"var:preset|spacing|20"}},"layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group"><!-- wp:details {"showContent":true,"style":{"border":{"width":"1px","radius":"10px"},"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"var:preset|spacing|30","bottom":"var:preset|spacing|30","left":"var:preset|spacing|40","right":"var:preset|spacing|40"}}},"borderColor":"border"} -->
<details class="wp-block-details has-border-color has-border-border-color" open style="border-width:1px;border-radius:10px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)"><summary>What If I Don't Want to Work With Plant Medicine?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">That is completely okay. At Lumina, participation in plant medicine ceremonies is encouraged, but never required if a guest is feeling apprehensive.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">We recognize that people arrive at different places in their healing journey. Some guests feel called to work directly with sacred plant medicines, while others may not feel ready, may have personal reasons not to participate, or may simply feel that their path at this moment is not ready for medicine. All of these choices are respected and honored.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">Guests who choose the non-medicine path remain fully included in the retreat experience. You will participate in the opening and closing circles, daily Qi Gong, teachings, meditation practices, group integration, community activities, and the complete 4-E Elemental Wisdom Process. You will be held within the same supportive container, receive the same personal guidance, and engage in the same deep exploration of the patterns, beliefs, emotions, and unconscious structures that shape your life.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">During ceremony evenings, non-medicine participants remain part of the ceremonial space and collective experience. Many guests find that simply being present within a focused and intentional environment, supported by music, meditation, reflection, and inquiry, can open meaningful insights and profound healing of its own.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">Most importantly, healing does not belong to any one modality. While plant medicine can be a powerful catalyst, lasting transformation ultimately comes from your willingness to look honestly at yourself, engage fully with the process, and apply what you discover to your life. The 4-E Process was designed to help facilitate that transformation, whether medicine is part of your journey or not.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">At Lumina, there is no "lesser" path. There is only your path. Our role is to meet you where you are, support you with compassion and care, and help you move toward greater freedom, clarity, and wholeness in a way that feels safe, aligned, and authentic to you.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"style":{"border":{"width":"1px","radius":"10px"},"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"var:preset|spacing|30","bottom":"var:preset|spacing|30","left":"var:preset|spacing|40","right":"var:preset|spacing|40"}}},"borderColor":"border"} -->
<details class="wp-block-details has-border-color has-border-border-color" style="border-width:1px;border-radius:10px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)"><summary>Where will we stay?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">On-site, together, in a private retreat center, in either a private or shared room. The retreat center is located in the Verde Valley, on the river, about 30 minutes from Sedona.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"style":{"border":{"width":"1px","radius":"10px"},"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"var:preset|spacing|30","bottom":"var:preset|spacing|30","left":"var:preset|spacing|40","right":"var:preset|spacing|40"}}},"borderColor":"border"} -->
<details class="wp-block-details has-border-color has-border-border-color" style="border-width:1px;border-radius:10px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)"><summary>How do I get there?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">Most guests fly into Phoenix Sky Harbor, which has the widest selection of flights — about an hour-and-a-half drive to Sedona. Flagstaff is closer, with a beautiful hour's drive down the canyon, but offers fewer flights. Travel isn't included, but we'll point you to shuttle options and directions.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"style":{"border":{"width":"1px","radius":"10px"},"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"var:preset|spacing|30","bottom":"var:preset|spacing|30","left":"var:preset|spacing|40","right":"var:preset|spacing|40"}}},"borderColor":"border"} -->
<details class="wp-block-details has-border-color has-border-border-color" style="border-width:1px;border-radius:10px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)"><summary>How many guests attend each retreat?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">Lumina intentionally keeps retreat groups small (12 maximum) to ensure a more personal, supportive, and individualized experience.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">This allows for meaningful connections, deeper group cohesion, and greater access to guidance and support throughout the retreat.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"style":{"border":{"width":"1px","radius":"10px"},"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"var:preset|spacing|30","bottom":"var:preset|spacing|30","left":"var:preset|spacing|40","right":"var:preset|spacing|40"}}},"borderColor":"border"} -->
<details class="wp-block-details has-border-color has-border-border-color" style="border-width:1px;border-radius:10px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)"><summary>What's the deposit and cancellation policy?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">A $500 non-refundable deposit secures your place, with the balance due one week before the retreat. If you've paid in full and need to cancel, we refund your payment minus the $500 deposit.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"style":{"border":{"width":"1px","radius":"10px"},"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"var:preset|spacing|30","bottom":"var:preset|spacing|30","left":"var:preset|spacing|40","right":"var:preset|spacing|40"}}},"borderColor":"border"} -->
<details class="wp-block-details has-border-color has-border-border-color" style="border-width:1px;border-radius:10px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)"><summary>Is Ayahuasca safe?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">Safety is one of our highest priorities.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">All guests complete a detailed health screening and intake process before acceptance into the retreat. Certain medications, medical conditions, and psychological conditions may require additional review or may not be compatible with participation. Every guest is carefully screened before being accepted, and our full approach to safety and care is laid out on our Care Protocol page. The application is the first step in that conversation.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">We encourage complete honesty throughout the screening process so we can provide the safest and most supportive environment possible.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"style":{"border":{"width":"1px","radius":"10px"},"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"var:preset|spacing|30","bottom":"var:preset|spacing|30","left":"var:preset|spacing|40","right":"var:preset|spacing|40"}}},"borderColor":"border"} -->
<details class="wp-block-details has-border-color has-border-border-color" style="border-width:1px;border-radius:10px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)"><summary>What makes Lumina different from other retreats?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">Many retreats focus primarily on the ceremony experience. At Lumina, we believe the ceremony is only part of the journey.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">Our unique 4-E Elemental Wisdom Process helps guests understand, integrate, and embody what emerges during retreat so the insights become lasting change rather than temporary experiences.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">The goal is not simply to have a profound experience. The goal is to create meaningful transformation that continues long after you return home.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"style":{"border":{"width":"1px","radius":"10px"},"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"var:preset|spacing|30","bottom":"var:preset|spacing|30","left":"var:preset|spacing|40","right":"var:preset|spacing|40"}}},"borderColor":"border"} -->
<details class="wp-block-details has-border-color has-border-border-color" style="border-width:1px;border-radius:10px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)"><summary>What if I've never done Ayahuasca before?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">Many of our guests are first-time participants.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">You do not need any previous experience. Prior to retreat, you will receive preparation materials and guidance to help you understand the process and prepare both mentally and physically.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">Our team is available to answer questions before arrival and support you throughout the retreat experience.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"style":{"border":{"width":"1px","radius":"10px"},"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"var:preset|spacing|30","bottom":"var:preset|spacing|30","left":"var:preset|spacing|40","right":"var:preset|spacing|40"}}},"borderColor":"border"} -->
<details class="wp-block-details has-border-color has-border-border-color" style="border-width:1px;border-radius:10px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)"><summary>What if I'm nervous?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">Almost everyone feels some level of nervousness before attending.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">Stepping into the unknown can feel vulnerable, especially when entering a process of deep self-exploration. Nervousness is often a sign that something meaningful matters to you. It's usually a good sign.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">Our role is not to push you beyond your readiness, but to provide a safe, supportive, and compassionate environment where you can move at a pace that feels appropriate for you.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"style":{"border":{"width":"1px","radius":"10px"},"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"var:preset|spacing|30","bottom":"var:preset|spacing|30","left":"var:preset|spacing|40","right":"var:preset|spacing|40"}}},"borderColor":"border"} -->
<details class="wp-block-details has-border-color has-border-border-color" style="border-width:1px;border-radius:10px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)"><summary>What happens during the ceremonies?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">Each ceremony is conducted within a carefully held and intentional setting.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">While every person's experience is unique, ceremonies may involve deep emotional insight, personal reflection, healing experiences, spiritual exploration, or a greater understanding of recurring patterns in life.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">Guests are encouraged to approach the experience with openness rather than expectation.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"style":{"border":{"width":"1px","radius":"10px"},"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"var:preset|spacing|30","bottom":"var:preset|spacing|30","left":"var:preset|spacing|40","right":"var:preset|spacing|40"}}},"borderColor":"border"} -->
<details class="wp-block-details has-border-color has-border-border-color" style="border-width:1px;border-radius:10px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)"><summary>What is the 4-E Elemental Wisdom Process?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">The 4-E Process is Lumina's unique framework for transformation and integration.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">It helps guests identify the underlying structures beneath recurring emotional patterns, limiting beliefs, and life challenges. Through guided inquiry and experiential practices, participants learn how to work with these patterns consciously rather than remaining unconsciously driven by them.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">The 4-E Process is introduced during retreat and becomes a lifelong tool that guests can continue using long after they return home.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"style":{"border":{"width":"1px","radius":"10px"},"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"var:preset|spacing|30","bottom":"var:preset|spacing|30","left":"var:preset|spacing|40","right":"var:preset|spacing|40"}}},"borderColor":"border"} -->
<details class="wp-block-details has-border-color has-border-border-color" style="border-width:1px;border-radius:10px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)"><summary>What is included in the four-week integration program?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">Every guest receives private sessions across four weeks of post-retreat integration support.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">This period helps participants apply what they have learned to everyday life, deepen their understanding of the retreat experience, and continue working with the 4-E Process.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">Integration is often where the most lasting transformation occurs, as insights become embodied and begin shaping changes in relationships, health, work, and daily living.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"style":{"border":{"width":"1px","radius":"10px"},"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"var:preset|spacing|30","bottom":"var:preset|spacing|30","left":"var:preset|spacing|40","right":"var:preset|spacing|40"}}},"borderColor":"border"} -->
<details class="wp-block-details has-border-color has-border-border-color" style="border-width:1px;border-radius:10px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)"><summary>What should I bring?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">Prior to retreat, you will receive a detailed preparation handbook and packing list.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">In general, guests should bring comfortable clothing, layers for changing temperatures, walking shoes, a flashlight, personal toiletries, a water bottle, and an open mind.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"style":{"border":{"width":"1px","radius":"10px"},"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"var:preset|spacing|30","bottom":"var:preset|spacing|30","left":"var:preset|spacing|40","right":"var:preset|spacing|40"}}},"borderColor":"border"} -->
<details class="wp-block-details has-border-color has-border-border-color" style="border-width:1px;border-radius:10px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)"><summary>How physically demanding is the retreat?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">Not too demanding. People from ages 18 to 80 have participated in medicine journeys, and the retreat is designed to be accessible to most people.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">Daily Qi Gong, optional hikes, and time in nature are offered throughout the week, but guests are encouraged to listen to their bodies and participate according to their abilities and comfort level.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details {"style":{"border":{"width":"1px","radius":"10px"},"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"var:preset|spacing|30","bottom":"var:preset|spacing|30","left":"var:preset|spacing|40","right":"var:preset|spacing|40"}}},"borderColor":"border"} -->
<details class="wp-block-details has-border-color has-border-border-color" style="border-width:1px;border-radius:10px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)"><summary>What if difficult emotions arise?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">Difficult emotions are a natural part of healing and transformation.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">Rather than viewing these experiences as problems, we see them as opportunities for greater understanding, compassion, and freedom. Guests are supported throughout the retreat with guidance, community, and integration practices designed to help them navigate whatever emerges.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"muted"} -->
<p class="has-muted-color has-text-color">You do not have to do it alone.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --></section>
<!-- /wp:group -->
